---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy for StackPick Lab.">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Privacy policy</h1>
  <div class="prose-spl mt-6 max-w-3xl">
    <p><em>Last updated: August 12, 2026</em></p>
    <p>
      StackPick Lab (“we”) respects your privacy. This MVP policy covers the static site and any email capture we add.
    </p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email address</strong> if you subscribe (via our ESP once connected).</li>
      <li><strong>Basic analytics</strong> if we enable a privacy-friendly analytics provider (e.g. Cloudflare Web Analytics).</li>
      <li><strong>Server logs</strong> from our host (Cloudflare Pages) as part of normal delivery.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use information</h2>
    <p>To send newsletter issues you requested, improve content, and operate the site. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep cookies minimal. Third-party embeds or analytics, if added, may set their own cookies—disclosed here when enabled.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy requests, contact us via the method published on stackpicklab.com when the site launches.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
